  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {快勝|かいしょう}する (to win easily)\n- {快勝|かいしょう}を{収|おさ}める (to achieve an easy victory)\n- {快勝|かいしょう}を{飾|かざ}る (to adorn with an easy victory)\nImplies the victory was achieved smoothly and with relative ease, not necessarily by a huge margin but without significant struggle.\n\nVICTORY SCALE (by margin/effort):\n- {圧勝|あっしょう} (overwhelming victory - dominant)\n- {大勝|たいしょう} (big win - by large margin)\n- {快勝|かいしょう} (easy win - comfortable)\n- {辛勝|しんしょう} (narrow win - hard-fought)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {惨敗|ざんぱい} (crushing defeat - antonym)\n- {勝利|しょうり} (victory - neutral)",
